### 3. Sleepy Test
**Ref:** Peruma et al., ESEC/FSE 2020 · testsmells.org  
**Test:** `ProcessOrder_AsyncNotification_IsSent` (line 91)

```csharp
// ❌ SMELL — hard-coded 2-second sleep; flaky & slow
