## Extended Catalog Finding

### 10. Assertion Roulette
**Ref:** Peruma et al., CASCON 2019 · testsmells.org  
**Test:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 70)

```csharp
// ❌ SMELL — 3 assertions, none with a failure message
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m, order.TaxAmount);
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);
```

When one fails, the MSTest runner reports "Assert.AreEqual failed" with no context on *which* amount was wrong.

**Fix:** Add messages:
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(expectedSubtotal, order.TotalAmount, "Subtotal mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedTax, order.TaxAmount, "Tax mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedGrand, order.GrandTotal, "Grand total mismatch");
```

